  "body": "## Result\n\nAdds a bounded negative result for the selected pair-0 stage-0 forward / stage-1 backward boundary. Across all 112 pinned port pairs, the verifier checks every directed coordinate transvection `T_ij = I + E_ij` on `F_2^9`:\n\n- Each port has compatible maps: 77 ports have 6 and 35 ports have 42, for 1,932 incidences.\n- No one coordinate transvection works at every port.\n- `RESULT.json` records the exact per-port candidate sets.\n\nThe profile-only cost screen grants the mechanism two deleted rank-one boundary transitions per port and charges one rank-one shear. The selected local rank-one count falls from 2,412 to 21,701/9 per call. Its exact `a`-ceiling rises from `1690054109089/10^15` to `338060003381/200000000000000` (0.01455%), weakening this bound. No new construction, legal composition, supplier integration, or `kappa` is claimed.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```sh\npython3 -I -B research/rank1-transvection-boundary-seed0410/verify.py\npython3 scripts/research_package.py --package research/rank1-transvection-boundary-seed0410 --check-only\n```\n\nBoth the exact verifier and metadata/pin check passed locally on Python 3.14. The repository package runner requires Python 3.12, which is unavailable in this environment; no local registered replay or hosted-CI result is claimed. The PR workflow can run the declared Python 3.12 replay.\n\n## Scope and provenance\n\nSeed `0410adea86dfbb7cdf86b46ba736e993`, `recursive-interfaces` / `persistent-boundary`, priority revision 3, exact base `e112d71c8d7bb32435debcc54df932593dd8223a`. Full source pins, selected-record provenance, task card, result, and remaining obligations are in `research/rank1-transvection-boundary-seed0410/`.\n\nThis expands on the literal shared-axis test in Discussion #1986. PR #1155, PR #1930, PR #2060, and Discussion #2007 were checked and have distinct scopes; overlap refresh covered 350 open PRs and 729 discussions/comments with complete pagination and no warnings at 2026-10-14 18:49 UTC.\n\nSubstantial OpenAI Codex assistance is disclosed in `TASK.json`. Apache-2.0.\n",
